    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you will know the </strong>truth<strong>, and the </strong>truth <strong>will make you free...\u00a0</strong>or it will drive you crazy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonya considers herself the messiah. She is obsessed with the idea of creating her own spiritual teaching, centered on you.\u00a0 Create your divine plan.\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect and talk about God. Wander through different planes of existence. Collect and combine items. Talk to people, angels, cats and other creatures. Help Sonya promote religion. Find out the girl's story.\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several fundamentally different endings and roots of the passage (it does not apply to the demo, it is linear) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original soundtrack\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice pixel graphics</p></li></ul>",
